  triage:title "Windows-only unused `source` binding in read_response_frame_with_helper -- fails just lint on windows-latest" ;
  triage:resolution "FIXED in integrate/phase-AI @ 98e6fc38. Windows-only unused source binding at crates/atm-daemon-client/src/lib.rs corrected: parameter renamed to _source in Windows cfg-gated closure. Verified: just lint passes on all CI platforms (macos-latest, ubuntu-latest, windows-latest)." ;
  triage:description "AI4-QA-1 (quality-mgr, blocking, CI-only regression in this sprint's own diff). crates/atm-daemon-client/src/lib.rs:455, the #[cfg(windows)]-gated closure `.map_err(|source| { AtmError::daemon_unavailable(\"failed to spawn daemon local IPC read helper\") })` binds `source` but never uses it. 5 sibling call sites in the same file (protocol.rs read-path equivalents) were correctly renamed to `_source` during AI.4's error-consumer migration; this one site was missed. Fails windows-latest `just lint`, blocks merge gate. Verified directly on feature/pAI-s4-error-consumer-migration @ baf86e22 by team-lead." ;
